    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1290">

                <pb facs="1267" n="1257" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1257"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.8573/5–1249: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-12T15:00:00+08:00">May 12, 1949—3 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 12—9:06 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1611. Security officer recommends arming American guards with 45–caliber pistols.
                    Appreciate expression Department policy this matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
